  "$comment": "Component set for Kinora's trimmed release FFmpeg (P0-05b), the single source of truth for scripts/ffmpeg/release/build.mjs (configure flags) and `verify.mjs --release` (what the static libraries must contain). Built with --disable-everything --disable-autodetect plus these. Names are FFmpeg component names as `ffmpeg -decoders|-encoders|-demuxers|-muxers|-bsfs|-protocols|-filters` print them; release/components.mjs maps the few that configure spells differently (libvpx-vp9 -> libvpx_vp9, demuxer mpeg -> mpegps). Validated by scripts/ffmpeg/check-components.py against the dev build. Rationale per group in docs/spikes/S2-report.md §6; parsers, hwaccels, hwdevices and implicit were added by P0-05b (docs/spikes/P0-05b-report.md).",
